# Short notes on the FX track set the grain pitch and it stays: C5 (+1 octave), G4 (+7), C3 (-1 octave), E4 (+4),
# then C4 (back to the input's pitch). P2 0 keeps the grains tight: a granular pitch shifter. A held note shorter than
# 0.4 s does not freeze. Bend +-2 semitones transposes the next grains.
tempo 120
steps 48
tail 1
track fx1
input saw 165 0.25
preset 170 0 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
gain 1
transport 0 stop                 # sequencer stopped: the free cloud (sync.scn has the time lock)
note 4 C5 2 100
note 10 G4 2 100
note 16 C3 2 100
note 22 E4 2 100
bend 26 200
bend 30 -200
bend 34 0
note 38 C4 2 100
expect sound 2 48
expect peak_below -3
